sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as User
    participant Router as React Router DOM v7
    participant AuthGuard as AuthGuard
    participant OnbGuard as OnboardingGuard
    participant Screen as DashboardScreen

    User->>Router: Navigate to `/dashboard`
    Router->>AuthGuard: Evaluate Active Supabase JWT
    alt No Token / Expired
        AuthGuard-->>User: Redirect to `/login?redirect=/dashboard`
    end
    AuthGuard->>OnbGuard: Evaluate `profiles.onboarding_completed`
    alt Onboarding Incomplete
        OnbGuard-->>User: Redirect to `/onboarding` (Resume FSM)
    end
    OnbGuard->>Screen: Render `/dashboard` within `AppLayout`
    Screen-->>User: Render Home Dashboard
